# work app list — consumed by `make work` (one command per line).
# Copy to work/<VM>.apps (e.g. work/poste.apps) and edit.
# '#' comments and blank lines are ignored. Each line is launched on YOUR
# screen over SSH X11 (ssh -Y -f), so GUI apps only.
#
# Examples:
ghidra
burpsuite
wireshark
# firefox-esr https://target.lab
